share/smithy/ holds Smithy 2.0 AST JSON files vendored from upstream
(by default, awslabs/aws-sdk-rust's aws-models tree).

The vendored .smithy.json files are committed to git — `make dist`
ships the tree as-is, no build-time vendoring required.

Layout: share/smithy/<service>/<service>.smithy.json - matches
Paws::Model::Loader::Resolver's nested-layout search path.

Refresh from upstream:
  1. Bump the SHA in .upstream-sha to the desired
     awslabs/aws-sdk-rust commit.
  2. Run `make vendor-smithy` (drives script/paws-vendor-smithy --clean).
  3. `git diff --stat` to verify the diff scope.
  4. Commit the bumped pin file with the regenerated tree.

The refresh-source-deps workflow (.github/workflows/refresh-source-deps.yml)
runs this on a daily schedule and opens a draft PR with the
regenerated tree whenever upstream moves.
